{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "74b05b2ee571345d98e6a34a2c66fabe610a58b3ad8d4b2dd17df2176d0b85b5", "ja": "（京都の神社仏閣巡りの番組に、雪歩が出演する。\n前乗りして、番組で行くルートを下見しているが……）", "zh": "（雪步要参加一档游览京都神社寺院的节目。\n提前过来，先熟悉一下节目中的路线，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f3c0df9f388fda2064813527e987c74c12ce5777a92fb124f7d9dc6388718ae5", "ja": "お待たせしました、{$P$}！\nお願い事に時間かかっちゃって……。", "zh": "让您久等了，{$P$}！\n\n许愿花了点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2caff0638a69a2eab57da386d6ecbcd4d772bc063b027d76e18baac122acc785", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。時間はたっぷりあるし。\nやけに長いことお願いしてるな……とは思ったけど。", "zh": "没关系。时间多得很呢。\n不过我倒是在想……你许愿的时间还挺长的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "64f24fcd28966452158ebb07138bea52ee8d7dc9dfe5afb816de89bb1ee45062", "ja": "あうぅ、やっぱり……。すみません。一個\nお願い事を思いついたら、止まらなくなっちゃって。", "zh": "啊呜，果然还是……对不起。一想到一个愿望，就停不下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ba024dd61282cc106e186e1b1f3174076c02cfda663690b4cb15a545ecb8e62a", "ja": "お願いをそんなに欲張る私なんて、ダメダメで\n罰当たりですよね……。ご、ごめんなさいぃ！", "zh": "像我这样贪心地提这么多愿望，真是太差劲、太不知足了……对、对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1005_p", "source_sha256": "77c135973b32ec0b2c68a6f99e98699febec54ed83be7ca55295f893ac41e5be", "ja": "いや。そんなに謝らなくても……。", "zh": "不用那么拼命道歉啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d8a68ecec2c78646768fd3041f57098592a9744857a1cf921efca6137521cf3e", "ja": "こうなったら穴掘って……ああ、でも境内を掘る\nわけにはいかないし……。どうしよう～！", "zh": "既然这样，那就挖个洞……啊，可是也不能在神社境内挖洞……怎么办呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9f387d9bee6a49ab126fa28d5db18d6bbd09f9a9dcf62919b723354181c040f7", "ja": "……雪歩、少し落ち着こう。とりあえず、\n願い事がたくさんあるのは悪いことじゃないと思う！", "zh": "……雪步，先冷静一下。总之，\n我觉得愿望多并不是什么坏事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1008_p", "source_sha256": "670d8fd114b01e9a9d1391dcdc9687f24153f7197326031c91644e462e379b28", "ja": "俺も交通安全とか、健康のこととかも\nお願いしたしな！", "zh": "我也拜托神明保佑交通安全，还有身体健康之类的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e9f2ee96e91d71c9a535aec7a0860bbbdb8dd3e7ca1cdbd0c82e50410b3bb44a", "ja": "そうなんですか！　私も……家族や劇場のみんなが\n健康でいられますようにって、お願いしたんですよ。", "zh": "是这样啊！我也……祈求家人和剧场的大家都能身体健康。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "28256c9102af5819a3a8e0c467bd9c2185de57aaa90b0b2cae34a973cfe1aecf", "ja": "それと、明日のロケがうまくいきますようにとか。\nロケ中に犬に出会いませんようにとか……。", "zh": "还有，希望明天的外景拍摄能顺利。以及，希望拍摄期间不要遇到狗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "db38b37a83139ec9c3de72903d67d524ab2831856dfe5ecc0d4b82985d83fd49", "ja": "他にも、苦手なことが、ちょっとだけ克服できます\nように……美味しいお茶に出会えますように……。", "zh": "另外，也希望能稍微克服一些不擅长的事情……希望能遇到好喝的茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b87e25d265fdaf0c098f418073ff8a0c2e19a401dd0948c9e5c9f2d22df1b471", "ja": "ははは、なるほど。\nそれだけお願いしてたら、長くなるのも納得だな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n许下这么多愿望，难怪会花这么长时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7545a1e9bb6d5f47e32b2486ee30dc29167772d6ec831221d402e1685107732d", "ja": "やっぱり、欲張りすぎですよね……。でもでも！\nもしひとつだけって言われたら、これです。", "zh": "果然，还是太贪心了吧……不过不过！  \n如果只能许一个愿望，那就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "af46c081f494d68eab37ddd1a8d3ce9279e83c71a10450822bc10da9adf97ea2", "ja": "これからも{$P$}の側で\nアイドルでいられますように……って。", "zh": "今后也能陪在{$P$}身边，继续当偶像……这是我的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b605ca2e90ee2ee7123f5725c505876e4d990b9ff4182af36181fb7411e6599d", "ja": "雪歩……。はは、じゃあ考えることは、案外同じだな。\n俺も、実は真っ先にお願いしたことがあるんだ。", "zh": "雪步……哈哈，那看来我们想的意外地一样啊。我其实也有一件最先许下的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1016_p", "source_sha256": "418a24929ae6aa5a5cb2abc5316ac636894e2642a4ae47941e2a2cdfaf8bac3f", "ja": "アイドル・萩原雪歩の活躍を、\nこれからもずっと支えていけますように、って。", "zh": "我许的愿是，希望今后也能一直支持偶像·萩原雪步的活跃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e1bf254baef778693afdaec5ecc97e876619ab0a14b2c16b422a29e39e96509a", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nふふっ。本当に、一緒ですね。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n呵呵，真的和我一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ab961cf8071d50b3b051213d7fa377978ecd6bb0c19a8571385a6b5f1c6ddc54", "ja": "だからって、願いが叶うのをただ待つつもりはないぞ。\nこれからも精一杯、プロデュースしていくからな。", "zh": "不过，我可没打算只是等着愿望实现。今后也会竭尽全力做好制作工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b9f1d90c9adb92fc3d916b0b886ff5fe614ca9167106d31167c3d5c8a760209c", "ja": "はい……！\n私もお願いが全部叶うように、努力します！", "zh": "好的……！\n我也会努力，让所有愿望都能实现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "18f4621a1c227626aae515c58f6e796c6ff601b5b034645e8df4ccbfd41ebf34", "ja": "そのためにもまずは、明日のロケですよね。\n……が、頑張りますぅ！", "zh": "所以首先就是明天的外景拍摄，对吧。\n……我、我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0414_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f039583a25653971e63b07324d91aeda4fe5411f93a3820394716f2220215fe6", "ja": "（雪歩の願いと熱意は、きっと届いたはずだ。\n神様も味方にして、ロケの成功は間違いなしだな！）", "zh": "（雪步的愿望和热情，一定已经传达出去了。\n连神明都站在我们这边，外景拍摄肯定能顺利完成！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
